        "notes": "FLIES FLIES FLIES centers queer, questioning, and sex-positive characters in a world that is often hostile towards them. The search for queer joy and empowerment drive the story, but depictions of transphobia, homophobia, and biphobia are prevalent in order to portray queer struggle honestly and cathartically. This is not a feel-good story."
